# data/ is bind-mounted in dev and never baked in — with ONE exception.
# The API needs the 11 MB routing graph at runtime, and baking it in is what
# lets a managed host (Render, Fly, Cloud Run) run this with no persistent
# disk at all. Everything else here is either processing-only or huge.
data/derived
data/outbox
data/cache/dem
